# The one playwright install the whole sub-app shares. It used to live in scheme/tools/ with a
# symlink pointing here, tools/ is gone and this is the real directory now. Anything run from a
# subdirectory needs none of its own: Node walks up and finds this one.
node_modules

# The panel/geometry walk `tools/walk.mjs` takes for the report tier. It is a PIPELINE STAGE and not
# a cache: `npm run report` retakes it every time, nothing keys or reuses it, and no test can read a
# walk of a tree that has since changed. Ignored because it is generated, not because it is optional.
.snapshot
